    "scoring": {
      "value": "Opus 4.8、Llama 4 Maverick、Gemini 3.1 Pro独立二元判决后多数票；最终轮权重平均，空回复0；10000次bootstrap区间。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12758",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
